{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-dnc.md","title":"对角非可计算函数","display":"df-dnc — 对角非可计算函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-dnc","aliases":["20-df-dnc"],"display":"df-dnc — 对角非可计算函数","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 10.3.1","source_pdf_pages":[217],"source_printed_pages":[185],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-dnc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-dnc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dnc — 对角非可计算函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 10.3.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dnc}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\varphi_e(e)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}_D(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}^A(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^A(e)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dnc}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\varphi_e(e)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}_D(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}^A(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^A(e)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>普通 DNC 对全部自然数输出避对角；二值 DNC 将值域限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，强度更高。相对 DNC 对相对编号避对角，不是仅把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 改成 oracle 可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.3.1；印刷页 185；PDF 第 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dnc}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\varphi_e(e)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}_D(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{DNC}^A(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\\n[\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^A(e)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1347,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ad118641da6f3c9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]。"},{"id":"84e66db8dad1fed1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"e7923f429b681274","ancho